WEBVTT

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.456
(Laughter)

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:03.176
You mean to tell me
that people worked their whole lives,

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:05.776
buying cars, clothes,
homes and material stuff

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.016
but were living check to check?

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:12.376
How in the world were members of society
going to help incarcerated individuals

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:13.616
back into society

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.520
if they couldn't manage they own stuff?

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.416
We screwed.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.176
(Laughter)

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:20.600
I needed a better plan.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.640
This is not going to work out too well.

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:26.240
So ...

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.080
I thought.